+# Render deploy (QPPV API)
+
+Companion to [`PILOT-DEPLOY.md`](./PILOT-DEPLOY.md). Use this for a **sellable** pilot (always-on API).
+
+## Why not free tier
+
+| Mode | What happens | Sellable? |
+|------|----------------|-----------|
+| Free | Sleeps ~15 min idle; cold start 30–60s; can be **suspended** for billing/quota | No |
+| **Starter** (recommended) | Always on; health stays green for demos | Yes |
+
+`render-keepalive.yml` only fights free-tier sleep. It **cannot** resume a suspended service.
+
+## Blueprint deploy
+
+1. Open [Render Dashboard](https://dashboard.render.com) → **New** → **Blueprint**.
+2. Connect `Dr-kersho/QPPV-Agent` and select root [`render.yaml`](../render.yaml).
+3. Set secrets when prompted (`DATABASE_URL`, AI keys, Qdrant, `ADMIN_API_KEY`).
+4. Confirm plan is **Starter** (Blueprint sets `plan: starter`).
+5. Deploy. Note the service URL, e.g. `https://qppv-api.onrender.com`.
+
+### Manual Web Service (no Blueprint)
+
+- **Root / Docker context:** `backend`
+- **Dockerfile:** `backend/Dockerfile`
+- **Health check path:** `/health`
+- **Plan:** Starter
+- Env vars: see [`.env.example`](../.env.example) + `BACKEND_CORS_ORIGINS=["https://qppv-agent.vercel.app"]`
+
+## After first deploy
+
+In Render Shell (or one-off job):
+
+```bash
+alembic upgrade head   # entrypoint already runs this on boot
+python -m app.scripts.seed_demo
+python -m app.scripts.seed_rag --docs-dir ./regulatory_docs
+python -m app.scripts.seed_training
+```
+
+Point Vercel `BACKEND_URL` at the Render URL and redeploy the frontend.
+
+## Suspended service runbook
+
+**Symptom:** `curl -D- https://qppv-api.onrender.com/health` returns HTTP 503 with `x-render-routing: suspend` and HTML titled "Service Suspended". Login shows offline (not “waking up”).
+
+**Fix (operator only):**
+
+1. Render Dashboard → service `qppv-api` → **Resume** (or clear billing hold / upgrade off free).
+2. Wait until the service is **Live**.
+3. Run:
+
+```bash
+./scripts/verify-pilot-health.sh
+./scripts/verify-pilot-health.sh https://qppv-api.onrender.com/health
+```
+
+4. Confirm demo login: `demo@qppv.eg` / `demo1234` on https://qppv-agent.vercel.app/login
+
+Keep-alive failures that print `SUSPENDED` mean the same runbook — do not wait for a cold start.
